<title>HUNGARY: Budapest bourse changes designation of shares.</title>
<headline>Budapest bourse changes designation of shares.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) said it has renamed its two share categories as per its new trading and introduction rules.</p>
<p>From now on, the listed and traded categories will respectively be called &quot;listed A&quot; and &quot;listed B&quot;.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
</text>
